मयि सर्वमिदं प्रोतं सूत्रे मणिगणा इव ॥ ७ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2143,\"bb\":1899,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/7/b1899/\",\"body_value\":\"mattaḥ parataraṁ nānyat
