प्रणव: सर्ववेदेषु शब्द: खे पौरुषं नृषु ॥ ८ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2155,\"bb\":1910,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/8/b1910/\",\"body_value\":\"raso ’ham apsu kaunteya
prabhāsmi śaśi-sūryayoḥ
praṇavaḥ sarva-vedeṣu
śabdaḥ khe pauruṣaṁ nṛṣu\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2156,\"bb\":1911,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/8/b1911/\",\"shadow_value\":\"rasaḥ – taste; aham – I; apsu – in water; kaunteya – O son of Kuntī; prabhā – the light; asmi – I am; śaśi-sūryayoḥ – of the moon and the sun; praṇavaḥ – the three letters a-u-m; sarva – in all; vedeṣu – the Vedas; śabdaḥ – sound vibration; khe – in the ether; pauruṣam – ability; nṛṣu – in men.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"rasaḥ\",\"translation\":\"taste\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I\"},{\"word\":\"apsu\",\"translation\":\"in water\"},{\"word\":\"kaunteya\",\"translation\":\"O son of Kuntī\"},{\"word\":\"prabhā\",\"translation\":\"the light\"},{\"word\":\"asmi\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"śaśi-sūryayoḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the moon and the sun\"},{\"word\":\"praṇavaḥ\",\"translation\":\"the three letters a-u-m\"},{\"word\":\"sarva\",\"translation\":\"in all\"},{\"word\":\"vedeṣu\",\"translation\":\"the Vedas\"},{\"word\":\"śabdaḥ\",\"translation\":\"sound vibration\"},{\"word\":\"khe\",\"translation\":\"in the ether\"},{\"word\":\"pauruṣam\",\"translation\":\"ability\"},{\"word\":\"nṛṣu\",\"translation\":\"in men\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2157,\"bb\":1912,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/8/b1912/\",\"body_value\":\"O son of Kuntī, I am the taste of water, the light of the sun and the moon, the syllable oṁ in the Vedic mantras; I am the sound in ether and ability in man.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2158,\"bb\":1913,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/8/b1913/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2159,\"bb\":1914,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/8/b1914/\",\"body_value\":\"The light of the sun and the moon is also originally emanating from the brahma-jyotir, which is the impersonal effulgence of the Lord. And praṇava, or the oṁ-kāra transcendental sound in the beginning of every Vedic hymn, addresses the Supreme Lord. Because the impersonalists are very much afraid of addressing the Supreme Lord Kṛṣṇa by His innumerable names, they prefer to vibrate the transcendental sound oṁ-kāra. But they do not realize that oṁ-kāra is the sound representation of Kṛṣṇa. The jurisdiction of Kṛṣṇa consciousness extends everywhere, and one who knows Kṛṣṇa consciousness is blessed. Those who do not know Kṛṣṇa are in illusion, and so knowledge of Kṛṣṇa is liberation, and ignorance of Him is bondage.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 7.8\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 7.8\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2a:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n30:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n26:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8