tejas tejasvinām aham\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":2169,\"bb\":1922,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/10/b1922/\",\"shadow_value\":\"bījam – the seed; mām – Me; sarva-bhūtānām – of all living entities; viddhi – try to understand; pārtha – O son of Pṛthā; sanātanam – original, eternal; buddhiḥ – intelligence; buddhi-matām – of the intelligent; asmi – I am; tejaḥ – prowess; tejasvinām – of the powerful; aham – I am.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"bījam\",\"translation\":\"the seed\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"Me\"},{\"word\":\"sarva-bhūtānām\",\"translation\":\"of all living entities\"},{\"word\":\"viddhi\",\"translation\":\"try to understand\"},{\"word\":\"pārtha\",\"translation\":\"O son of Pṛthā\"},{\"word\":\"sanātanam\",\"translation\":\"original, eternal\"},{\"word\":\"buddhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"intelligence\"},{\"word\":\"buddhi-matām\",\"translation\":\"of the intelligent\"},{\"word\":\"asmi\",\"translation\":\"I am\"},{\"word\":\"tejaḥ\",\"translation\":\"prowess\"},{\"word\":\"tejasvinām\",\"translation\":\"of the powerful\"},{\"word\":\"aham\",\"translation\":\"I am\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":2170,\"bb\":1923,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/10/b1923/\",\"body_value\":\"O son of Pṛthā, know that I am the original seed of all existences, the intelligence of the intelligent, and the prowess of all powerful men.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":2171,\"bb\":1924,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/10/b1924/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":2172,\"bb\":1925,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/7/10/b1925/\",\"body_value\":\"nityo nityānāṁ cetanaś ce